          "explanation": {
            "content": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Hexachloro means there are six Cl"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "–"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ligands present. Platinate(IV) means the central metal ion is Pt"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "4+"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". The charge is of the coordination sphere is: +4 + 6(–1) = –2. The coordination sphere is therefore [PtCl"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "6"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "]"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "2–"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "2226489401",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The compound is overall neutral, so there must be two Na"
                  },
                  {
                    "sup": true,
                    "text": "+"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " counterions to balance charge."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "34978590",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "We write the cation first and the anion second, so the formula is Na"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "2"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "[PtCl"
                  },
                  {
                    "sub": true,
                    "text": "6"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "]."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1253231995",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
